      "writtenOn": "2016-02-26T13:26:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wouldn\u0027t care about subset of roles, the only thing we need to ensure is that the user would be able to do the same operation in the subprojects by getting a token on them. It doesn\u0027t matter if the policy rule will pass thanks to other roles he has there.\n\nWe only ensure he has powers to do the same there.",
